WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.802
-You only have a half-hour
when you do your show.

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.370
Are there any things that's,
like, left out of your show

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:05.872
that we could help you with here
on our show tonight?

00:00:05.872 --> 00:00:07.540
-You know, I've been so busy.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.176
And I've just been
being spread so thin,

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:13.045
I haven't had a chance
to properly thank everyone

00:00:13.045 --> 00:00:14.547
I want to thank, and I know on
"The Tonight Show,"

00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:16.015
you usually do this
at the end of the week.

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:18.718
But I was hoping that maybe I
could do some thank-you cards

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:20.686
or thank-you notes.
-I mean, we could do --

00:00:20.686 --> 00:00:21.654
We can do this.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.423
-Can I do that? Can I do that?

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:25.357
-You want to sit there?
-Can I sit there?

00:00:25.357 --> 00:00:26.959
-Yeah, you can sit --
-Can you sit here?

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:29.062
I'm down. Let's do it.
-You're part of the family now.

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:30.530
You can do it.
You can use the desk.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.232
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:33.533
-Alright.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:34.333
-You can use this.

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:35.535
-Is this a first?

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.103
-Yeah, actually, it feels weird
sitting in this.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.971
-Are you nervous?
-I am. I'm totally nervous.

00:00:38.971 --> 00:00:40.673
-Don't worry.
I think I know what to do.

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:42.642
James, can I have
some thank-you music, please?

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:44.143 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:46.980
-Oh, my gosh.
You do know what you're doing.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:51.250
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:55.387
-Thank you, NBC,
for being the only network

00:00:55.387 --> 00:00:57.356
where a woman could have a show
after midnight

00:00:57.356 --> 00:00:59.158
that allows her
to keep her clothes on.

00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:03.629
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:03.629 --> 00:01:04.797
-That's exactly right.

00:01:04.797 --> 00:01:06.499
-I did my research.
I did my research.

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:09.568
-I don't put the cards
in the envelopes. This is great.

00:01:09.568 --> 00:01:13.072
-Thank you, "A Little Late,"
for being a good name

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:17.342
for a late-night talk show and a
great name for a pregnancy test.

00:01:17.342 --> 00:01:20.646
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:20.646 --> 00:01:22.982
-Yeah. It's an awful name
actually, yeah.

00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:26.152
"A Little Late."

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:29.655
-Thank you, Jimmy and Seth,

00:01:29.655 --> 00:01:32.926
for basically being the opening
acts to my show every night.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:34.693
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.693 --> 00:01:36.763
I don't say this
about a lot of people,

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.330
but I've got a feeling
that you guys

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:41.100
are really gonna break through
and make it big some day.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:45.605
-Oh, my gosh!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.841
I feel like -- I feel like --

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.575
You're almost
too comfortable here.

00:01:49.575 --> 00:01:50.876
-Did I do it?

00:01:50.876 --> 00:01:52.578
-We cannot wait for your show
to premiere tonight!

00:01:52.578 --> 00:01:54.847
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:01:54.847 --> 00:01:57.917
Here's a look at "A Little Late
with Lilly Singh."

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:59.419
Take a look at this.

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:02.488
♪ -Hello, my name is Lilly
and I ain't a white man ♪

00:02:02.488 --> 00:02:05.258
♪ My skin got some color
and it ain't a spray tan ♪

00:02:05.258 --> 00:02:08.060
♪ I know you used to only Jimmys
in the spotlight ♪

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:11.297
♪ But I'm-a throw some melanin
up in your late night ♪

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:14.133
♪ Now, America, this is you
but I'm your late-night host ♪

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:15.601
♪ This used to be a boys club ♪

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:17.170
♪ But I'm knocking down
the doors ♪

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:18.571
♪ It's time to switch it up
in here ♪

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.139
♪ 'Cause now a lady
runs the show ♪

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:23.076
♪ I'm 'bout to lead the way for
y'all with my pedicured toe ♪

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:26.145
♪ 'Cause I'm turning off the A/C
and I'm turning up the heat ♪

00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:29.115
♪ 'Cause I've been cold at
my 9-to-5 since I was a teen ♪

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:32.118
♪ Only lady in late night,
that's cool but F that ♪

00:02:32.118 --> 00:02:35.221
♪ I'm hired to be the only lady
