00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:36.922
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:36.922 --> 00:02:38.925
-Lilly Singh, everybody!

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:41.660
"A Little Late with Lilly Singh"
premieres tonight

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:44.597
at 1:35 a.m. on NBC!

